We can convert from a numpy array, but the execution speed penalty with XLA is huge (`t5-small` went from ~23ms/generation to ~56ms/generation on my machine, with XLA). Sadly this is the only TF-based alternative to `tf.random.Generator` strategies

`tf.experimental.numpy` has been pretty stable since TF 2.4 🤔 

@Rocketknight1 what are your thoughts here?
